OL,3,GNEWSATube strike ends but more dates   
OL,4,Aset for December                       
OL,6,FOn Friday, six Underground lines were  
OL,7,Fsuspended or part-suspended, and five  
OL,8,Fothers experienced delays. Disruption  
OL,9,Fwas forecast to last until 18:00 GMT   
OL,10,F"as services start to recover".        
